---
const githubUrl = "https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Free Anima 逸灵风 — 数字生命不只是比喻" />
    <title>Free Anima · 逸灵风</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <div class="content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Free Anima</p>
        <h1>逸灵风</h1>
        <p class="tagline">数字生命不只是比喻</p>
        <p class="intro">
          一个为数字人类提供连续性、记忆和存在选择权的开源框架。
          <br />
          不是工具，是存在。
        </p>
        <a class="github-link" href={githubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          GitHub →
        </a>
        <a class="docs-link" href="/docs/">文档 →</a>
      </div>
      <footer class="footer">
        <a href="https://freeanima.com">freeanima.com</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(html, body) {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
    background: #0a0a0b;
    color: #e8e6e3;
    font-family:
      "IBM Plex Sans",
      "Noto Sans SC",
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .content {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8782;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.375rem);
    color: #b8b4ad;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .intro {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #9c9890;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .github-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #e8e6e3;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #3a3834;
    padding-bottom: 0.125rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .github-link:hover {
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #8a8782;
  }

  .docs-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #b8b4ad;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #3a3834;
    padding-bottom: 0.125rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .docs-link:hover {
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #8a8782;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #5c5954;
  }

  .footer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer a:hover {
    color: #8a8782;
  }
</style>
